# Every tracked file is LF (checked 2026-10-19: `git ls-files --eol` lists no CRLF), and the
# shared vectors this repo holds verbatim from core are compared BYTE-identical by
# devtools' `vector-drift` (ledger #1886), so a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf` must not
# rewrite them. `text=auto` keeps the rest normalized to LF in the index.
* text=auto
crates/ikigai-mcp/tests/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
# Wire v10 stream vectors (ledger #2242), pinned verbatim by the faces: LF on every checkout.
crates/ikigai-wire/tests/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
